Hi @lululxvi,
I read through all the issues on boundary conditions, but still couldn't solve how to define u_x(0,t) = u_x(L,t) using OperatorBC.
Could you please give me a example?

For example, how to modify this code to satisfy u_x(0,t) = u_x(L,t)
def func(x, u, _):
   du_x = dde.grad.jacobian(u, x, i=0, j=0)
   return du_x

def boundary_r(x, on_boundary):
    return on_boundary and dde.utils.isclose(x[0], L)

def boundary_l(x, on_boundary):
   return on_boundary and dde.utils.isclose(x[0], 0)

Thank you in advance!
